RUN | $T/h/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/game_core.+x | $T/h/@.apps/demo-race | $T/g | replay
EXPECT_OUT_IS | REPLAY events=30 hash=c69a00ab222f3bf2 | CONTROL:-board.pdl-restored,-the-new-ledger-replays-again-(the-refusal-above-was-the-edit)
